{"name": "Set.pi_pow", "statement": "@[to_additive nsmul_pi]\nlemma pi_pow (s : Set ι) (t : ∀ i, Set (M i)) :\n    ∀ {n : ℕ}, n ≠ 0 → s.pi t ^ n = s.pi (fun i ↦ t i ^ n)\n  | 1, _ => by simp\n  | n + 2, _ => by simp [pow_succ _ (n + 1), pi_mul, ← pi_pow]", "module": "Tengoku.MeanFourier.MeanFourier.Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Pointwise.Set.Basic", "source_path": "MeanFourier/Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Pointwise/Set/Basic.lean", "library": "mean-fourier", "source_url": "https://github.com/YaelDillies/mean-fourier/blob/36975c9b7f20dbfc051b6907668954716ce1999d/MeanFourier/Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Pointwise/Set/Basic.lean", "toolchain": "leanprover/lean4:v4.34.0-rc2", "via": "equal"}
